[version]
1.1.2
[date]
2026-10-20
[whatsnew]
- Fixed kernel scheduler not seeing spawned processes (module caching in _G)
- Fixed Process.wait() to properly yield to scheduler
- Defensive colors in BIOS (wrapped in pcall for compatibility)
- GRUB-like interactive boot menu with arrow key navigation
- Removed F2 (didn't work in CC:T); only F12 for boot menu now
- New `update` command (replaces arch-update) with check/install/ver/wn/repo subcommands
- Installer defaults to Tsundereplan/archos-cc (no args needed)
- Password confirmation in installer (asks twice, retries if mismatch)
- Optional user account creation during install (added to wheel group)
[/whatsnew]
